外资机构在华分支机构，应说明本机构处置计划与集团处置计划的关系。", "score": 0.9286111111111112, "rerank_score": 0.8786111111111111, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "mcq_exact_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "multiple_choice_evidence", "fusion_method": "mcq_exact_support_early_stop", "exact_support_score": 0.9286}}]}
```

